  "problemStatement": {
    "formal": "",
    "plain": "Show that for a symmetric function f(i,j) = f(j,i), the off-diagonal sum Σ_{i≠j} f(i,j) = 2·Σ_{i<j} f(i,j). Applied to products xᵢxⱼ, this gives Σ_{i≠j} xᵢxⱼ = 2·e₂.",
